# PR 8875 real-app proof, run 2026-10-23T14:17Z. Redacted: passwords show as <pw1>/<pw2>/<redacted>, URL credentials as <redacted-credentials>, the API key as <throwaway-project-key>. Store ports: 18240 = lw8875-ch, 15440 = lw8875-pg, 16390 = lw8875-redis (see docker ps below).
